<title>CROATIA: WEIGHTLIFTING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>WEIGHTLIFTING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIJEKA, Croatia 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the European weightlifting championships on Thursday:</p>
<p>64 kg</p>
<p>1. Hasim Suleymanoglu (Turkey) snatch 142.5 kg/clean and jerk 165 kg, total lift 307.5.</p>
<p>2. Zoltan Farkas (Hungary) 140/165, 305</p>
<p>3. Marian Nikola Dodita (Romania) 132.5/162.5, 295.</p>
</text>
